{
  "defaults": {
    "denoise": 1,
    "sampler_name": "euler",
    "scale_by": 2,
    "scheduler": "simple",
    "upscale_method": "lanczos"
  },
  "description": "Video restoration and upscaling with SeedVR2 7B, no prompt needed; frame rate and sound come from the source",
  "groups": [{
    "id": 1,
    "member_nodes": ["5", "note:1"],
    "title": "Diffusion Model"
  }, {
    "id": 2,
    "member_nodes": ["6", "note:2"],
    "title": "VAE Configuration"
  }, {
    "id": 3,
    "member_nodes": ["3", "note:3"],
    "title": "Upscale Configuration"
  }, {
    "id": 4,
    "member_nodes": ["8", "11", "note:4"],
    "title": "Temporal Chunks"
  }],
  "name": "SeedVR2 Video Upscale",
  "nodes": {
    "1": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Source Video"
      },
      "class_type": "LoadVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "file": "source_upload.mp4 [input]"
      }
    },
    "10": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "KSampler"
      },
      "class_type": "KSampler",
      "inputs": {
        "cfg": 1,
        "denoise": "0.75",
        "latent_image": ["8", 0],
        "model": ["100", 0],
        "negative": ["9", 1],
        "positive": ["9", 0],
        "sampler_name": "dpmpp_2m",
        "scheduler": "karras",
        "seed": "1234567890123",
        "steps": 1
      }
    },
    "100": {
      "class_type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly",
      "inputs": {
        "lora_name": "main_lora.safetensors",
        "model": ["5", 0],
        "strength_model": 0.800000011920929
      }
    },
    "11": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Merge Latents"
      },
      "class_type": "SeedVR2TemporalMerge",
      "inputs": {
        "latents": ["10", 0],
        "temporal_overlap": ["8", 1]
      }
    },
    "12": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "VAE Decode (Tiled)"
      },
      "class_type": "VAEDecodeTiled",
      "inputs": {
        "overlap": 128,
        "samples": ["11", 0],
        "temporal_overlap": 8,
        "temporal_size": 64,
        "tile_size": 512,
        "vae": ["6", 0]
      }
    },
    "13": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Post-Process"
      },
      "class_type": "SeedVR2PostProcessing",
      "inputs": {
        "color_correction_method": "none",
        "images": ["12", 0],
        "original_resized_images": ["3", 0]
      }
    },
    "14": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Create Video"
      },
      "class_type": "CreateVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "audio": ["2", 1],
        "bit_depth": ["2", 3],
        "fps": ["2", 2],
        "images": ["13", 0]
      }
    },
    "15": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Save Video"
      },
      "class_type": "SaveVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "codec": "auto",
        "filename_prefix": "video/ComfyChair",
        "format": "auto",
        "video": ["14", 0]
      }
    },
    "2": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Get Video Components"
      },
      "class_type": "GetVideoComponents",
      "inputs": {
        "video": ["1", 0]
      }
    },
    "3": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Upscale Frames"
      },
      "class_type": "ResizeImageMaskNode",
      "inputs": {
        "input": ["2", 0],
        "resize_type": "scale by multiplier",
        "resize_type.multiplier": "1.25",
        "scale_method": "bislerp"
      }
    },
    "4": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Preprocess"
      },
      "class_type": "SeedVR2Preprocess",
      "inputs": {
        "resized_images": ["3", 0]
      }
    },
    "5": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Diffusion Model"
      },
      "class_type": "UNETLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "unet_name": "unet.safetensors",
        "weight_dtype": "default"
      }
    },
    "6": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load VAE"
      },
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "vae.safetensors"
      }
    },
    "7": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "VAE Encode (Tiled)"
      },
      "class_type": "VAEEncodeTiled",
      "inputs": {
        "overlap": 128,
        "pixels": ["4", 0],
        "temporal_overlap": 8,
        "temporal_size": 64,
        "tile_size": 512,
        "vae": ["6", 0]
      }
    },
    "8": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Split Latent"
      },
      "class_type": "SeedVR2TemporalChunk",
      "inputs": {
        "chunking_mode": "auto",
        "latent": ["7", 0],
        "temporal_overlap": 1
      }
    },
    "9": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Conditioning"
      },
      "class_type": "SeedVR2Conditioning",
      "inputs": {
        "model": ["100", 0],
        "vae_conditioning": ["8", 0]
      }
    }
  },
  "notes": [{
    "content": "### Recommended UNET Model\n\nUse **SeedVR2 7B Int8** for restoration and upscaling in a single step. The **3B Int8** model is faster and needs less VRAM.",
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Diffusion Model Selection"
  }, {
    "content": "### Recommended VAE\n\nUse the **SeedVR2 EMA** VAE (fp16). It encodes and decodes in tiles, in space and in time, so large and long outputs fit in memory.",
    "id": 2,
    "title": "VAE Selection"
  }, {
    "content": "### Recommended Settings\n\n- **Scale by:** 2 (the output grows with the square of the factor, in every frame)\n- **Upscale method:** lanczos\n- **Denoise:** 1.0\n\n---\n\n*SeedVR2 works in one sampling step and doesn't use a prompt. The result keeps the source's length, frame rate and sound.*",
    "id": 3,
    "title": "Upscale Settings"
  }, {
    "content": "### Long Videos\n\nThe latent is split into chunks that fit in free VRAM (**auto**) and sampled one at a time; adjacent chunks share one latent frame, crossfaded when merged.\n\n*For a fixed chunk size switch Split Latent to **manual** (frames per chunk: 4n+1).*",
    "id": 4,
    "title": "Temporal Chunks"
  }]
}
